\chapter{Jenks 原书插图}
\newpage
\subsection{复 Gamma 函数}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81complexgamma.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{complexgamma}
gam(x:DoubleFloat,y:DoubleFloat):Point(DoubleFloat) == _
  ( g:Complex(DoubleFloat):= Gamma complex(x,y) ; _
    point [x,y,max(min(real g, 4), -4), argument g] )
v3d:=draw(gam, -%pi..%pi, -%pi..%pi, title == "Gamma(x + %i*y)", _
          var1Steps == 100, var2Steps == 100, style=="smooth")
\end{chunk}
一个三维曲面,其高度是 Gamma 函数的实部,颜色则是 Gamma 函数的辐角。

\newpage
\subsection{复反正切函数}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81complexarctangent.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{complexarctangent}
atf(x:DoubleFloat,y:DoubleFloat):Point(DoubleFloat) == _
 ( a := atan complex(x,y) ; _
   point [x,y,real a, argument a] )
v3d:=draw(atf, -3.0..%pi, -3.0..%pi, style=="shade")
rotate(v3d,210,-60)
\end{chunk}
复反正切函数。高度是实部,颜色是辐角。


\chapter{Hyperdoc 示例}
