f3(x,y) == y^2 + 4*x^2 - 2*x

lineColorDefault(color(3))
viewport3:=draw(f3(x,y)=0,x,y,range==[-4.0..4.0,-4.0..4.0],adaptive==true,_
                unit==[1.0,1.0])
graph3:=getGraph(viewport3,1)

f4(x,y) == y^2 - x^2 - 3*x/10

lineColorDefault(color(4))
viewport4:=draw(f4(x,y)=0,x,y,range==[-4.0..4.0,-4.0..4.0],adaptive==true,_
                unit==[1.0,1.0])
graph4:=getGraph(viewport4,1)

f5(x,y) == y^2 - x^2 - x/2

lineColorDefault(color(5))
viewport5:=draw(f5(x,y)=0,x,y,range==[-4.0..4.0,-4.0..4.0],adaptive==true,_
                unit==[1.0,1.0])
graph5:=getGraph(viewport5,1)

f6(x,y) == y^2 - x^2 -7*x/10

lineColorDefault(color(6))
viewport6:=draw(f6(x,y)=0,x,y,range==[-4.0..4.0,-4.0..4.0],adaptive==true,_
                unit==[1.0,1.0])
graph6:=getGraph(viewport6,1)

putGraph(viewport1,graph2,2)
putGraph(viewport1,graph3,3)
putGraph(viewport1,graph4,4)
putGraph(viewport1,graph5,5)
putGraph(viewport1,graph6,6)
units(viewport1,1,"on")
points(viewport1,1,"off")
points(viewport1,2,"off")
points(viewport1,3,"off")
makeViewport2D(viewport1)

\end{chunk}
{\center{\includegraphics[height=8cm,width=8cm]{ps/v81crcp60-2.9.11.1-6.eps}}}
\label{CRCp60-2.9.11.1-6}
\index{figures!CRCp60-2.9.11.1-6}

\chapter{意面设计}
这是一本书\cite{Lege11},它把意面形状的分类法与在三维空间中实现这些
形状的 Mathematica 方程结合在一起。我们把书中的示例在 Axiom 里重新
实现,作为图形功能的测试集。

\newpage
\section{Acini Di Pepe}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81acinidipepe.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Acini Di Pepe}
X(i,j) == 15*cos(i/60*%pi)
Y(i,j) == 15*sin(i/60*%pi)
Z(i,y) == j
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..120,j=0..30,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Acini Di Pepe",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
{\sl postine minute}(细小意面)家族中体型最小的成员,{\sl acini de
pepe}(意为“胡椒粒”)最适合搭配清汤(consomm\'e),有时也会加入一些
面包丁与切碎的青菜。acini di pepe 由杜兰小麦粉与鸡蛋制成,常用于意大利
裔美国人的“婚礼汤”(wedding soup)——一种以蔬菜与肉类同煮而成的清汤。

\newpage
\section{Agnolotti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81agnolotti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Agnolotti}
X(i,j) == (10*sin((i/120)*%pi)^(0.5) + _
           (1/400)*sin(((3*j)/10)*%pi)) * _
          cos(((19*j)/2000)*%pi+0.03*%pi)
Y(i,j) == (10*sin((i/120)*%pi) + _
           (1/400)*cos(((30*j)/10)*%pi)) * _
          sin(((19*j)/2000)*%pi+0.03*%pi)
Z(i,j) == 5*cos((i/120)*%pi)^5 * sin((j/100)*%pi) - _
          5*sin((j/100)*%pi) * cos((i/120)*%pi)^200
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..60,j=0..100,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Agnolotti",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,0.6,0.6,0.6)
\end{chunk}
这种来自意大利北部皮埃蒙特(Piedmont)的贝壳状{\sl ravioli}
(意式饺子),是用小麦粉与鸡蛋做成的压扁小面片制成的,常常包入炖小
牛肉、猪肉、蔬菜或奶酪作馅。真正的 agnolotto 应带有褶皱的边缘,需用
波纹滚轮刀切出。搭配融化黄油与鼠尾草风味最佳。

\newpage
\section{Anellini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81anellini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Anellini}
X(i,j) == cos(0.01*i*%pi)
Y(i,j) == 1.1*sin(0.01*i*%pi)
Z(i,j) == 0.05*j
canvas := createThreeSpace()
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
makeObject(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..8,space==canvas,_
           colorFunction==cf,style=="smooth")
makeObject(surface(X(i,j)/1.4,Y(i,j)/1.4,Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..8,_
           space==canvas,colorFunction==cf,style=="smooth")
vp:=makeViewport3D(canvas,style=="smooth",title=="Anellini")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
zoom(vp,1.1,1.1,1.1)
\end{chunk}
娇小的{\sl onellini}(小圆环)是庞大的{\sl postine minute}
(细小意面)家族的一支。它们的粗细只在 1.15 到 1.20 毫米之间,因此
通常出现在清淡的汤品中,搭配面包丁与切得很薄的蔬菜。这种意面也可见
于{\sl timballo}(意式烤面食)之中。

\newpage
\section{Bucatini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81bucatini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Bucatini}
X(i,j) == 0.3*cos(i/30*%pi)
Y(i,j) == 0.3*sin(i/30*%pi)
Z(i,j) == j/45
canvas := createThreeSpace()
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
makeObject(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..60,j=0..90,space==canvas,_
           colorFunction==cf,style=="smooth")
makeObject(surface(X(i,j)/2,Y(i,j)/2,Z(i,j)),i=0..60,j=0..90,space==canvas,_
           colorFunction==cf,style=="smooth")
vp:=makeViewport3D(canvas,style=="smooth",title=="Bucatini")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
zoom(vp,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl Bucatini}(意为“穿孔的”)这种意面通常以{\sl pastasciutta}
的方式食用(即意面煮熟沥干后拌上酱汁,而非泡在清汤里)。与之最相配
的酱汁是{\sl amatriciana}:一种以风干猪肉、佩科里诺罗马诺奶酪
(Pecorino Romano)与番茄酱调制而成的传统浓郁酱汁,得名于意大利
中部的中世纪小镇阿马特里切(Amatrice)。

\newpage
\section{Buccoli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81buccoli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Buccoli}
X(i,j) == (0.7 + 0.2*sin(21*j/250 * %pi))*cos(i/20*%pi)
Y(i,j) == (0.7 + 0.2*sin(21*j/250 * %pi))*sin(i/20*%pi)
Z(i,j) == 39.0*i/1000. + 1.5*sin(j/50*%pi)
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..25,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Buccoli",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
作为{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族里一种螺旋形的成员,{\sl
buccoli} 的来历颇为不明,适合用于蘑菇香肠料理。它们与番茄茄子、
香蒜酱(pesto)和乳清干酪(ricotta)沙拉搭配也十分出色。

\newpage
\section{Calamaretti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81calamaretti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Calamaretti}
X(i,j) == cos(i/75*%pi) + 0.1*cos(j/40*%pi) + 0.1*cos(i/75*%pi + j/40*%pi)
Y(i,j) == 1.2*sin(i/75*%pi) + 0.2*sin(j/40*%pi)
Z(i,j) == j/10
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..20,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Calamaretti",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.1,1.1,1.1)
\end{chunk}
字面意思是“小鱿鱼”,{\sl calamaretti} 是一种小圆环状的意面,以
{\sl pastasciutta} 方式烹制(煮熟沥干),再拌上以番茄、鸡蛋或奶酪
为底的酱汁。它们的形状使{\sl calamaretti} 无论是浓稠还是稀薄的酱汁
都能挂得很好。也正因如此,常与海鲜同食。

\newpage
\section{Cannelloni}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81cannelloni.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Cannelloni}
X(i,j) == (1+j/100)*cos(i*%pi/55) + 0.5*cos(j*%pi/100) + _
          0.1*cos(i*%pi/55+j*%pi/125)
Y(i,j) == 1.3*sin(i*%pi/55) + 0.3*sin(j*%pi/100)
Z(i,j) == 7.*j/50.
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..110,j=0..50,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Cannelloni",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl cannelloni}(大管子)由小麦粉、鸡蛋和橄榄油制成,最初是压平
的意面条,卷成规整的圆筒状,可以填入肉类、蔬菜或乳清干酪作馅。填好
馅料的{\sl cannelloni} 上会浇一层浓郁的{besciamella}(白汁奶油酱),
撒上帕玛森干酪(Parmigiano-Reggiano),再入烤箱烘烤。

\newpage
\section{Cannolicchi Rigati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81cannolicchirigati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Cannolicchi Rigati}
X(i,j) == 8*cos(i*%pi/70) + 0.2*cos(2*i*%pi/7) + 5*cos(j*%pi/100)
Y(i,j) == 8*sin(i*%pi/70) + 0.2*sin(2*i*%pi/7) + 4*sin(j*%pi/100)
Z(i,j) == 6.0*j/5.0
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..140,j=0..50,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Cannolicchi Rigati",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,2,7)
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
意为“小管子”,{\sl cannolicchi} 既有{\sl rigati}(带纹路的)也
有{\sl lisci}(光滑的)形态。这种中空的{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)
有多种直径,常与海鲜搭配食用。{\sl Cannolicchi} 来自意大利南部的
坎帕尼亚(Campania)地区。

\newpage
\section{Capellini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81capellini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Capellini}
X(i,j) == 0.05*cos(2*i*%pi/15) + 0.6*cos(j*%pi/100)
Y(i,j) == 0.05*sin(2*i*%pi/15) + 0.5*sin(j*%pi/100)
Z(i,j) == 7.0*j/100.0
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..15,j=0..100,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Capellini",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl capellini}(意为“细发”)是一种极细的杆状意面,既可用清淡
的高汤烹制,也能与黄油、肉豆蔻或柠檬完美搭配。这个品种(或是它更
纤细的近亲{\sl capelli d'angelo}(意为“天使的头发”))有时还被
用作一道以柠檬和杏仁制成的特别甜点意面——{\sl torta ricciolina}
——的基底。

\newpage
\section{Cappelletti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81cappelletti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Cappelletti}
X(i,j) == (0.1 + sin(((3*i)/160)*%pi)) * cos(((2.3*j)/120)*%pi)
Y(i,j) == (0.1 + sin(((3*i)/160)*%pi)) * sin(((2.3*j)/120)*%pi)
Z(i,j) == 0.1 + (1/400.)*j + (0.3 - 0.231*(i/40.)) * cos((i/20.)*%pi)
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..40,j=0..120,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Cappelletti",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.1,1.1,1.1)
\end{chunk}
这种意面按传统会作为意大利北部圣诞大餐的头道菜,盛在鸡汤(brodo)
里端上桌。通常是家里的孩子们在平安夜准备 cappelletti(小帽子):把
小麦粉与新鲜鸡蛋做成的意面小包,填入什锦肉馅或乳清干酪之类的软质
奶酪。

\newpage
\section{Casarecce}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81casarecce.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Casarecce}
X(i,j) == _ 
  if (i <= 30)_
   then 0.5*cos(j*%pi/30)+0.5*cos((2*i+j+16)/40*%pi) _
   else cos(j*%pi/40)+0.5*cos(j*%pi/30)+0.5*sin((2*i-j)/40*%pi)
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 30)_
   then 0.5*sin(j*%pi/30)+0.5*sin((2*i+j+16)/40*%pi) _
   else sin(j*%pi/40)+0.5*sin(j*%pi/30)+0.5*cos((2*i-j)/40*%pi)
Z(i,j) == j/4.0
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..60,j=0..60,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Casarecce",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
凭借独特的 s 形截面很容易辨认,{\sl casarecce}(意为“自制的”)
最适合以{\sl postasciutta}方式烹制(煮熟沥干后拌酱汁)。{\sl
casarecce} 常搭配经典的{\sl ragu}(肉酱),再撒上一点胡椒和帕玛森
干酪调味。

\newpage
\section{Castellane}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81castellane.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Castellane}
X(i,j) == ((0.3*sin(j*%pi/120)*abs(cos((j+3)*%pi/6)) + _
           i^2/720.*(sin(2*j*%pi/300)^2+0.1) + 0.3)) * cos(7*i*%pi/150)
Y(i,j) == ((0.3*sin(j*%pi/120)*abs(cos((j+3)*%pi/6)) + _
           i^2/720.*(sin(2*j*%pi/300)^2+0.1) + 0.3)) * sin(7*i*%pi/150)
Z(i,j) == 12*cos(j*%pi/120)
cf(x:DFLOAT,y:DFLOAT):DFLOAT == 1.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..60,j=0..120,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Castellane",colorFunction==cf)
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
viewpoint(v3d,0.0,0.0,45.0)
viewpoint(v3d,5,5,0)
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
生产商 Bailla 最近创制了这种优雅的意面形状。据其制造商所说,这款
意面最初被称为{\sl paguri}(寄居蟹),后来改名为{\sl castellane}
(城堡居民)。{\sl castellane} 扎实的形态与浓郁的坚果风味,足以撑
起丰盛的正餐与味道浓烈的酱汁。

\newpage
\section{Cavatappi}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81cavatappi.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Cavatappi}
X(i,j) == (3+2*cos(i*%pi/35)+0.1*cos(2*i*%pi/7))*cos(j*%pi/30)
Y(i,j) == (3+2*cos(i*%pi/35)+0.1*cos(2*i*%pi/7))*sin(j*%pi/30)
Z(i,j) == 3+2*sin(i*%pi/35)+0.1*sin(2*i*%pi/7)+j/6.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..70,j=0..150,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Cavatappi")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl cavatappi}(开瓶器)与用羊肉或猪肉做成的浓稠酱汁绝配,是一种
长 36 毫米、中空的螺旋管状意面。除了搭配{\sl boscaiola}(樵夫风味)
一类的奶油酱汁外,它们也常用于烤箱焗奶酪的菜式,或是拌香蒜酱(pesto)
的沙拉中。

\newpage
\section{Cavatelli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81cavatelli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Cavatelli}
A(i) == 0.5*cos(i*%pi/100)
B(i,j) == j/60.*sin(i*%pi/100)
X(i,j) == 3*(1-sin(A(i)*2*%pi))*cos(A(i)*%pi+0.9*%pi)
Y(i,j) == 3*sin(A(i)*2*%pi)*sin(A(i)*%pi+0.63*%pi)
Z(i,j) == 4*B(i,j)*(5-sin(A(i)*%pi))
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..30,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Cavatelli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,5,50)
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl cavatelli} 在意大利南部颇受欢迎,形状与更长的扭曲状{\sl
casareccia} 相近,可以做成{\sl alla puttanesca}(意为“妓女式”,
酱汁含辣椒、大蒜、刺山柑与鳀鱼)。它们也可以加入沙拉,搭配橄榄油、
炒香的蒜末与撒一层软质奶酪。

\newpage
\section{Chifferi Rigati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81chifferirigati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Chifferi Rigati}
X(i,j) == (0.45+0.3*cos(i*%pi/100)+0.005*cos(2*i*%pi/5)) * cos(j*%pi/45) + _
          0.15*(j/45.0)^10*cos(i*%pi/100)^3
Y(i,j) == (0.35+j/300.0)*sin(i*%pi/100) + 0.005*sin(2*i*%pi/5)
Z(i,j) == (0.4+0.3*cos(i*%pi/100))*sin(j*%pi/45)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..45,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Chifferi Rigati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,90,180)
\end{chunk}
这种意面——有{\sl rigoti}(带纹路的)与{\sl lisci}(光滑的)
两种形态——通常用高汤烹煮,或搭配{\sl rogu alla bolognese}
(博洛尼亚肉酱)食用,不过{\sl chifferi rigati} 加入胡萝卜、红椒
与西葫芦的沙拉里也非常出色。{\sl Chifferi rigoti} 与奥地利的
'kipfel' 甜点形似,其名称正是该词的音译。

\newpage
\section{Colonne Pompeii}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81colonnepompeii.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Colonne Pompeii}
X0(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 50) _
   then 2*cos(i*%pi/20) _
   else 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*cos(-j*%pi/25)
Y0(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 50) _
   then 0.0 _
   else 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*sin(-j*%pi/25) + 3*sin((j-50)*%pi/200)
Z0(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 50) _
   then sin(i*%pi/20)+12 _
   else sin(i*%pi/20)+6.0*j/25.0
X1(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 200) _
   then 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*cos(-j*%pi/25+2*%pi/3) _
   else 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*sin(-28*%pi/3)
Y1(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 200) _
   then 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*sin(-j*%pi/20 + 2*%pi/3) + 3*sin(j*%pi/200) _
   else 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*sin(-28*%pi/3)
Z1(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 200) _
   then 12+sin(i*%pi/20)+6.0*j/25.0 _
   else sin(i*%pi/20)+60
X2(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 200) _
   then 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*cos(-j*%pi/25+4*%pi/3) _
   else 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*sin(-28*%pi/3)
Y2(i,j) == _
  if (j <= 200) _
   then 2*cos(i*%pi/200)*sin(-j*%pi/25+4*%pi/3)+3*sin(j*%pi/200) _
   else 2*cos(i*%pi/20)*sin(-28*%pi/3)
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X0(i,j),Y0(i,j),Z0(i,j)),i=0..10,j=0..250,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X1(i,j),Y1(i,j),Z1(i,j)),i=0..10,j=0..250,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X2(i,j),Y2(i,j),Z1(i,j)),i=0..10,j=0..250,space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,title=="Colonne Pompeii",style=="smooth")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
zoom(vp,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
这种华丽的意面(最初来自意大利南部的坎帕尼亚)形状与{\sl
fusilloni}(大号的{\sl fusilli})相似,但明显更长。{\sl Colonne
Pompeii}(庞贝的石柱)最适合用新鲜罗勒、松子、切得很细的蒜片与橄榄
油调味,再撒上一层现磨帕玛森干酪。

\newpage
\section{Conchiglie Rigate}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81conchiglierigate.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Conchiglie Rigate}
A(i,j) == 0.25*sin(j*%pi/250)*cos((6*j+25)/25*%pi)
B(i,j) == ((40.0-i)/40.0)*(0.3+sin(j*%pi/250))*%pi
C(i,j) == 2.5*cos(j*%pi/125)+2*sin((40-i)*%pi/80)^10 * _
          sin(j*%pi/250)^10*sin(j*%pi/125+1.5*%pi)
X(i,j) == A(i,j)+cos(j*%pi/125)+(5+30*sin(j*%pi/250))*sin(B(i,j)) * _
          sin(i/40*(0.1*(1.1+sin(j*%pi/250)^5))*%pi)
Y(i,j) == A(i,j)+(5+30*sin(j*%pi/250))*cos(B(i,j)) * _
          sin(i/40*(0.1*(1.1+sin(j*%pi/250)^5))*%pi) + C(i,j)
Z(i,j) == 25.0*cos(j*%pi/250)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..40,j=0..250,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Conchiglie Rigate")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,45,45)
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
形状正如其名,{\sl conchiglie}(贝壳)有{\sl rigate}(带纹路的)
与{\sl lisce}(光滑的)两种形态。适合搭配清淡的番茄酱、乳清干酪或
{\sl pesto genovese}(热那亚香蒜酱),{\sl conchiglie} 精巧的贝壳
造型与纹路能把调味料牢牢锁住。较小的版本用于汤品,较大的贝壳则更常
拌上酱汁食用。

\newpage
\section{Conchigliette Lisce}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81conchigliettelisce.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Conchigliette Lisce}
A(i,j) == (60.0-i)/60.0*(0.5+sin(j*%pi/60))*%pi
B(i,j) == i/60.0*(0.1*(1.1+sin(j*%pi/60)^5))*%pi
C(i,j) == 2.5*cos(j*%pi/30)+2*sin((60-i)*%pi/120)^10 * _
          sin(j*%pi/60)^10*sin((j+45)*%pi/30)
X(i,j) == (5+30*sin(j*%pi/60))*sin(A(i,j))*sin(B(i,j))+cos(j*%pi/30)
Y(i,j) == (5+30*sin(j*%pi/60))*cos(A(i,j))*sin(B(i,j))+C(i,j)
Z(i,j) == 25*cos(j*%pi/60)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..60,j=0..60,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Conchigliette Lisce")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,45,45)
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
通常见于意大利中部和南部(尤其是坎帕尼亚地区),{\sl
conchigliette lisce}(小号光滑贝壳)可以放入{\sl minestrone}
(蔬菜浓汤)之类的汤品中食用。此外,这种贝壳形意面也可以搭配以肉类
或蔬菜为底的酱汁。

\newpage
\section{Conchiglioni Rigate}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81conchiglionirigate.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Conchiglioni Rigate}
A(i,j) == 0.25*sin(j*%pi/200)*cos((j+4)*%pi/4)
B(i,j) == i/40.0*(0.1+0.1*sin(j*%pi/200)^6)*%pi
C(i,j) == 2.5*cos(j*%pi/100)+3*sin((40-i)*%pi/80)^10 * _
          sin(j*%pi/200)^10*sin((j-150)*%pi/100)
X(i,j) == A(i,j)+(10+30*sin(j*%pi/200)) * _
          sin((40.0-i)/40*(0.3+sin(j*%pi/200)^3)*%pi) * _
          sin(B(i,j))+cos(j*%pi/100)
Y(i,j) == A(i,j)+(10+30*sin(j*%pi/200)) * _
          cos((40.0-i)/40*(0.3+sin(j*%pi/200)^3)*%pi) * _
          sin(B(i,j))+C(i,j)
Z(i,j) == 30.0*cos(j*%pi/200)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..40,j=0..200,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Conchiglioni Rigati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,45,45)
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl conchiglioni rigate}(大号带棱纹贝壳)的形状非常适合盛放
酱汁与馅料(鱼肉或畜肉均可),这种意面可以入烤箱烘烤,也可以放在
烤架下做成焗烤。{\sl Conchiglioni rigati} 常见于意大利裔美国菜
{\sl pasta primavera}(春蔬意面)中,搭配爽脆的时令春菜。

\newpage
\section{Corallini Lisci}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81corallinilisci.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Corallini Lisci}
X(i,j) == 0.8*cos(i*%pi/50)
Y(i,j) == 0.8*sin(i*%pi/50)
Z(i,j) == 3.0*j/50.0
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..140,j=0..70,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X(i,j)/2,Y(i,j)/2,Z(i,j)),i=0..140,j=0..70,space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Corallini Lisci")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
zoom(vp,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
作为{\sl postine minute}(细小意面)家族的一员,{\sl corallini
lisci}(小号光滑珊瑚)之所以得名,是因为它们中空穿孔的外观酷似意大利
人佩戴的珊瑚珠饰。它们体积很小(直径不超过 3.5 毫米),因此{\sl
corallini} 最适合用于高汤烹煮,比如托斯卡纳白豆汤。

\newpage
\section{Creste Di Galli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81crestedigalli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Creste Di Galli}
A(i)   == ((1+sin((1.5+i)*%pi))/2)^5
B(i,j) == 0.3*sin(A(i/140.)*%pi+0.5*%pi)^1000*cos(j*%pi/70.0)
C(i,j) == 0.3*cos(A(i/140.)*%pi)^1000*sin(j*%pi/70.0)
X(i,j) == (0.5+0.3*cos(A(i/140.)*2*%pi))*cos(j*%pi/70.0) + _
          0.15*(j/70.0)^10*cos(A(i/140.0)*2*%pi)^3 + B(i,j)
Y(i,j) == 0.35*sin(A(i/140.0)*2*%pi) + 0.15*j/70.0*sin(A(i/140.0)*2*%pi)
Z(i,j) == (0.4+0.3*cos(A(i/140.0)*2*%pi))*sin(j*%pi/70.0) + C(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..140,j=0..70,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Creste Di Galli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
作为{\sl pasta ripiena}(填馅意面)家族的一员,{\sl creste di
galli}(鸡冠)与{\sl galletti} 几乎完全相同,唯一区别在于它们的冠部
是光滑而非褶皱的。可以填馅、煮熟后拌上简单的{\sl marinara}
(水手风味)酱汁食用,酱汁由番茄、大蒜和罗勒调制而成。

\newpage
\section{Couretti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81couretti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Couretti}
X(i,j) == 2*cos(i*%pi/150)-cos(i*%pi/75)-sin(i*%pi/300)^150 - _
          (abs(cos(i*%pi/300)))^5
Y(i,j) == 2*sin(i*%pi/150)-sin(i*%pi/75)
Z(i,j) == j/10.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..300,j=0..10,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Couretti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
作为{\sl postine minute}(细小意面)家族里造型浪漫的一支,{\sl
cuoretti}(小心形)体积极其微小。事实上,连同{\sl acini di pepe}
在内,它们是最小的几种意面之一。与所有{\sl postine} 一样,它们可以
放入汤中食用,比如奶油鸡汤。

\newpage
\section{Ditali Rigati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81ditalirigati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Ditali Rigati}
X(i,j) ==       cos(i*%pi/100) + 0.03*cos((7*i)*%pi/40) + 0.25*cos(j*%pi/50)
Y(i,j) == 1.1 * sin(i*%pi/100) + 0.03*sin((7*i)*%pi/40) + 0.25*sin(j*%pi/50)
Z(i,j) == j/10.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..25,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Ditali Rigati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
作为意大利南部坎帕尼亚地区的又一特产,{\sl ditali rigati}
(带纹路的顶针)体型紧凑,通常长度不超过 10 毫米。和其他{\sl
pastine}(小意面)一样,它们常见于{\sl pasta e patate}(意面炖
土豆)之类的汤品中。它们敦实的造型使其成为冬日里管饱的小食,加入
沙拉也同样出色。

\newpage
\section{Fagottini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fagottini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fagottini}
A(i,j) == (0.8 + sin(i/100*%pi)^8 - 0.8 * cos(i/25*%pi))^1.5 + _
           0.2 + 0.2 * sin(1/100*%pi)
B(i,j) == (0.9 + cos(i/100*%pi)^8 - 0.9 * cos(i/25*%pi + 0.03*%pi))^1.5 + _
           0.3 * cos(i/100*%pi)
C(i,j) == 4 - ((4*j)/500)*(1+cos(i/100*%pi)^8 - 0.8*cos(i/25*%pi))^1.5
X(i,j) == cos(i/100*%pi) * _
          (A(i,j) * sin(j/100*%pi)^8 + _
           0.6 * (2 + sin(i/100*%pi)^2) * sin(j/50*%pi)^2)
Y(i,j) == sin(i/100*%pi) * _
          (B(i,j) * sin(j/100*%pi)^8 + _
           0.6 * (2 + cos(i/100*%pi)^2) * sin(j/50*%pi)^2)
Z(i,j) == (1 + sin(j/100*%pi - 0.5*%pi)) * _
           (C(i,j) * ((4*j)/500) * _
            (1 + sin(i/100*%pi)^8 - 0.8 * cos(i/25*%pi))^1.5)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..50,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Fagottini")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
作为 pasta ripiena(填馅意面)家族里颇具代表性的一员,fagottini
(小钱包)是用杜兰小麦面团切成的圆片做成的。在面片上放一勺乳清干酪、
蒸蔬菜、甚至炖水果,再把边角捏合收拢成一个小包。这种包好的饺子和
ravioli(意式饺子)相似,只是个头更大。

\newpage
\section{Farfalle}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81farfalle.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Farfalle}
A(i)   == sin((7*i+16)*%pi/40)
B(i,j) == (7.0*j/16.0)+4*sin(i*%pi/80)*sin((j-10)*%pi/120)
C(i,j) == 10*cos((i+80)*%pi/80)*sin((j+110)*%pi/100)^9
D(i,j) == (7.0*j/16.0)-4*sin(i*%pi/80)-A(i)*sin((10-j)*%pi/20)
-- E(i,j) was never defined. We guess at a likely function - close but wrong
E(i,j) == _
  if ((20 <= i) and (i <= 60)) _
   then 7*sin((i+40)*%pi/40)^3*sin((2*j*%pi)/10+1.1*%pi)^9 _
   else C(i,j)
F(i) == _
  if ((20 <= i) and (i <= 60)) _
   then 7*sin((i+40)*%pi/40)^3*sin((j+110)*%pi/100)^9 _
   else C(i,j)
X(i,j) == (3.0*i)/8.0+F(i)
Y(i,j) == _
  if ((10 <= j) and (j <= 70)) _
   then B(i,j)-4*sin(i*%pi/80)*sin((70-j)*%pi/120) _
   else if (j <= 10) _
         then D(i,j) _
         else E(i,j)
Z(i,j) == 3*sin((i+10)*%pi/20)*sin(j*%pi/80)^1.5
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..80,j=0..80,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Farfalle")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,0.5,0.5,0.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl farfalle}(蝴蝶)由杜兰小麦粉、鸡蛋和水调制而成,产自意大利
北部的艾米利亚-罗马涅(Emilia-Romagna)与伦巴第(Lombardy)地区。
最适合搭配浓郁的{\sl carbonara}(培根蛋酱,由奶油、鸡蛋与培根制成)
酱汁。视季节而定,{\sl farfalle} 有时也会配上青豆与鸡肉或火腿。

\newpage
\section{Farfalline}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81farfalline.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Farfalline}
A(i) == 30*cos(i*%pi/125)+0.5*cos((6*i)*%pi/25)
B(i) == 30*sin(i*%pi/125)+0.5*sin((6*i)*%pi/25)
X(i,j) == cos(3*A(i)*%pi/100)
Y(i,j) == 0.5*sin((3*A(i))*%pi/100)*(1+sin(j*%pi/100)^10)
Z(i,j) == B(i)*j/500.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..250,j=0..50,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Farfalline")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,45,45)
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
这种{\sl postine minute}(细小意面)家族中广为人知的成员体型
娇小,因此{\sl farfalline}(小蝴蝶)很适合用于清淡的汤品,比如
{\sl pomodori e robiolo}(番茄与软质奶酪的混合)。用褶边意面滚刀
切出形状,再从中间一捏,便造就了这标志性的外形。

\newpage
\section{Farfalloni}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81farfalloni.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Farfalloni}
A(i,j) == 10*cos((i+70)*%pi/70)*sin((2*j)*%pi/175+1.1*%pi)^9
B(j)   == 0.3*sin((6-j)*%pi/7+0.4*%pi)
C(i,j) == _
  if ((17 <= i) and (i <= 52)) _
   then 7*sin((i+35)*%pi/35)^3*sin((2*j*%pi)/175+1.1*%pi)^9 _
   else A(i,j)
D(i,j) == (j/2.0)+4*sin(i*%pi/70)*sin((j-10)*%pi/100) - _
          4*sin(i*%pi/70)*sin((60-j)*%pi/100)
E(i,j) == (j/2.0)+4*sin(i*%pi/70)+0.3*sin((2*i+2.8)*%pi/7)*sin((j-60)*%pi/20)
F(i,j) == (j/2.0)-4*sin(i*%pi/70)-0.3*sin((2*i+2.8)*%pi/7)*sin((10-j)*%pi/20)
X(i,j) == (3.0*i)/7.0+C(i,j)
Y(i,j) == _
  if ((10 <= j) and (j <= 60)) _
   then D(i,j) _
   else if (j <= 10) _
         then F(i,j) _
         else E(i,j)
Z(i,j) == 3*sin((2*i+17.5)*%pi/35.)*sin(j*%pi/70)^1.5
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..70,j=0..70,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Farfalloni")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
和{\sl farfalle} 一样,{\sl farfalloni}(大蝴蝶)很适合搭配以
番茄或黄油为底、加青豆与火腿的酱汁。它们与葫芦科蔬菜也是绝配,比如
烤西葫芦或南瓜泥,再撒上帕玛森干酪与一点{\sl noce moscata}
(肉豆蔻)。

\newpage
\section{Festonati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81festonati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Festonati}
X(i,j) == 5*cos(i*%pi/50)+0.5*cos(i*%pi/50)*(1+sin(j*%pi/100)) + _
          0.5*cos((i+25)*%pi/25)*(1+sin(j*%pi/5))
Y(i,j) == 5*sin(i*%pi/50)+0.5*sin(i*%pi/50)*(1+sin(j*%pi/100)) + _
          0.5*cos(i**%pi/25)*(1+sin(j*%pi/5))
Z(i,j) == j/2.0+2*sin((3*i+25)*%pi/50)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..100,j=0..100,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Festonati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
这种表面光滑的{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族成员,得名于
“festoon”(花彩饰带,一种呈花环般波状轮廓的装饰性织物)。{\sl
Festonati} 可以搭配烤茄子或自家种植的番茄,再撒上磨碎的斯卡莫扎
奶酪(scamorza)、新鲜罗勒、橄榄油、大蒜与红辣椒碎。

\newpage
\section{Fettuccine}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fettuccine.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fettuccine}
X(i,j) == 1.8*sin((4*i)*%pi/375)
Y(i,y) == 1.6*cos((6*i)*%pi/375)*sin((3*i)*%pi/750)
Z(i,j) == i/75.0 + j/20.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..10,_
          style=="smooth",title=="Fettuccine")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
这种著名的{\sl pasta lunga}(长意面)由杜兰小麦粉、水制成,若是{\sl fettuccine alluovo},还要加入鸡蛋,且以下蛋后数日内的最为理想。{\sl Fettuccine}(小丝带)发源于拉齐奥(Lazio)地区。它们在许多菜式中都很受欢迎,是搭配{\sl Alfredo}酱——奶油、帕尔马干酪、大蒜与欧芹调制而成的浓郁酱汁——的理想选择。

\newpage
\section{Fiocchi Rigati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fiocchirigati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fiocchi Rigati}
A(i,j) == 10*cos((i+80)*%pi/80)*sin((j+110)*%pi/100)^9
B(i,j) == 35.0*j/80.0+4*sin(i*%pi/80)*sin((j-10)*%pi/120)
X(i,j) == _
  if ((20 <= i) and (i <= 60)) _
   then 7*sin((i+40)*%pi/40)^3*sin((j+110)*%pi/100)^9 + 30.0*i/80.0 _
   else A(i,j) + 30.0*i/80.0
Y(i,j) == B(i,j)-4*sin(i*%pi/80)*sin((70-j)*%pi/120)
Z(i,j) == 3*sin((1+10)*%pi/20)*sin(j*%pi/80)^1.5-0.7*((sin(3*j*%pi/8)+1)/2)^4
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..80,j=0..80,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Fiocchi Rigati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl fiocchi rigati}(有槽薄片)是{\sl farfalle}家族的远亲,体型比{\sl farfalloni}或{\sl farfalline}都要小。它们表面的凹凸纹理比典型的{\sl farfalle}能挂住更多酱汁。若想尝尝更特别的做法,{\sl fiocchi rigati}也可以配番茄伏特加酱食用。

\newpage
\section{Fisarmoniche}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fisarmoniche.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fisarmoniche}
X(i,j) == (1.5+3*(i/70.0)^5+4*sin(j*%pi/200)^50)*cos(4*i*%pi/175)
Y(i,j) == (1.5+3*(i/70.0)^5+4*sin(j*%pi/200)^50)*sin(4*i*%pi/175)
Z(i,j) == j/50.0+cos(3*i*%pi/14)*sin(j*%pi/1000)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..70,j=0..1000,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Fisarmoniche")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl fisarmoniche}得名于手风琴——它们簇拥起伏的外形让人联想到手风琴的风箱——十分适合裹住浓稠的酱汁,酱汁会牢牢挂在它们的褶皱里。据说这种结实的意大利面发明于十五世纪,诞生地是意大利中东部马尔凯(Marche)大区的洛雷托(Loreto)镇。

\newpage
\section{Funghini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81funghini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Funghini}
A(i,j) == 5*cos(i*%pi/150)+0.05*cos(i*%pi/3)*sin(j*%pi/60)^2000
B(i,j) == j/30.0*(5*sin(i*%pi/150)+0.05*sin(i*%pi/3))
C(i,j) == j/10.0*(2*sin(i*%pi/150)+0.05*sin(i*%pi/3))
D(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 150) _
   then B(i,j) _
   else if (j <= 10) _
         then C(i,j) _
         else 2*sin(i*%pi/150)+0.05*sin(i*%pi/6)
X(i,j) == 0.05*cos(A(i,j)*%pi/5)+0.3*cos(A(i,j)*%pi/5)*sin(3*D(i,j)*%pi/50)^2
Y(i,j) == 0.01*sin(A(i,j)*%pi/5)+0.3*sin(A(i,j)*%pi/5)*sin(3*D(i,j)*%pi/50)^2
Z(i,j) == 0.25*sin((D(i,j)+3)*%pi/10)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..300,j=0..30,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Funghini")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
作为{\sl pastine minute}(迷你意面)的一员,{\sl funghini}(小蘑菇)个头娇小,特别适合用来煮汤,比如用切碎并煸炒过的根芹菜做成的{\sl minestrone}(蔬菜浓汤)。

\newpage
\section{Fusilli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fusilli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fusilli}
X(i,j) == 6*cos((3*i+10)*%pi/100)*cos(j*%pi/25)
Y(i,j) == 6*sin((3*i+10)*%pi/100)*cos(j*%pi/25)
Z(i,j) == (3.0*i)/20.0+2.5*cos((j+12.5)*%pi/25)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..25,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Fusilli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl fusilli}(小纺锤)是{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族里颇受欢迎的一类,最初的做法是把一根{\sl spaghetto}(意大利细面)迅速缠绕在一根粗针上制成。最适合做成{\sl pastasciutta}(煮熟沥干的意面),配上一份加了辣香肠片的奶香酱汁。

\newpage
\section{Fusilli al Ferretto} 
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fusillialferretto.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fusilli al Ferretto} 
A(i,j) == 6.0*i/7.0+15*cos(j*%pi/20)
X(i,j) == (3+1.5*sin(i*%pi/140)^0.5*sin(j*%pi/20))*sin(13*i*%pi/280) + _
          5*sin(2*A(i,j)*%pi/135)
Y(i,j) == (3+1.5*sin(i*%pi/140)^0.5*sin(j*%pi/20))*cos(13*i*%pi/280)
Z(i,j) == A(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..140,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Fusilli al Ferretto")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
要做出这种那不勒斯(Neapolitan)风味的{\sl fusilli},需先将少量杜兰小麦粉和成面团,贴着一根{\sl ferretto}(小铁棍)放好,再用双手来回搓动,搓出一条粗细不匀的面卷。成形后取下,放在一种叫{\sl spasa}的柳条托盘上晾干。{\sl fusilli al ferretto}最适合配羊肉{\sl ragu}(肉酱)享用。

\newpage
\section{Fusilli Capri}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fusillicapri.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fusilli Capri}
X(i,j) == 6*cos(j*%pi/50)*cos((i+2.5)*%pi/25)
Y(i,j) == 6*cos(j*%pi/50)*sin((i+2.5)*%pi/25)
Z(i,j) == 2.0*i/3.0 + 14*cos((j+25)*%pi/50)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Fusilli Capri")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl fusilli Capri}是{\sl fusilli}在当地演变出的一种更长、更紧实的形态,适合搭配羊肉或猪肉香肠做成的浓郁{\sl ragu}(肉酱),也可以配芝麻菜和柠檬做成更清爽的一道菜。

\newpage
\section{Fusilli Lunghi Bucati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81fusillilunghibucati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Fusilli Lunghi Bucati}
A(i,j) == 10+cos(i*%pi/10)+2*cos((j+10)*%pi/10)+10*cos((j+140)*%pi/160)
B(i,j) == 20+cos(i*%pi/10)+2*cos((j+10)*%pi/10)
C(i,j) == (j+10.0)*%pi/10.0
D(i,j) == i*%pi/10.0
E(i,j) == 7+20*sin((j-20)*%pi/160)
F(i,j) == 70*(0.1-(j-180.0)/200.0)
X(i,j) == _
  if ((20 <= j) and (j <= 180)) _
   then A(i,j) _
   else if (j <= 20) _
         then cos(D(i,j))+2*cos(C(i,j)) _
         else B(i,j)
Y(i,j) == _
  if ((20 <= j) and (j <= 180)) _
   then sin(D(i,j))+2*sin(C(i,j)) _
   else sin(D(i,j))+2*sin(C(i,j))
Z(i,j) == _
  if ((20 <= j) and (j <= 180)) _
   then E(i,j) _
   else if (j <= 20) _
         then ((7.0*j)/20.0) _
         else F(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..20,j=0..200,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Fusilli Lunghi Bucati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl fusilli lunghi bucati}(长孔{\sl fusilli})是{\sl fusilli}大家族里颇具特色的一员,发源于意大利南部的坎帕尼亚(Campania),外形宛如弹簧。和所有{\sl fusilli}一样,传统上配肉类{\sl ragu}(肉酱)食用,但也可以拌浓稠的蔬菜酱后放入烤箱烘烤。

\newpage
\section{Galletti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81galletti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Galletti}
A(i)   == ((1+sin(i*%pi+1.5*%pi))/2)^5
B(i,j) == 0.4*sin(A(i/140)*%pi+0.5*%pi)^1000*cos(j*%pi/70)
C(i,j) == 0.15*sin(A(i/140)*%pi+0.5*%pi)^1000*cos(j*%pi/7)
D(i,j) == 0.4*cos(A(i/140)*%pi)^1000*sin(j*%pi/70)
X(i,j) == (0.5+0.3*cos(A(i/140)*2*%pi))*cos(j*%pi/70) + _
          0.15*(j/70.0)^10*cos(A(i/140)*2*%pi)^3 + B(i,j)
Y(i,j) == 0.35*sin(A(i/140)*2*%pi)+0.15*(j/70.0)*sin(A(i/140)*2*%pi)+C(i,j)
Z(i,j) == (0.4+0.3*cos(A(i/140)*2*%pi))*sin(j*%pi/70) + D(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..140,j=0..70,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Galletti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
据其生产商 Barilla 所说,{\sl galletti}(小公鸡)一名的来历已不可考,但它们的形状让人想起{\sl chifferi},只是多了一道波浪状的鸡冠。{\sl galletti}通常配番茄酱食用,但与蘑菇做的{\sl boscaiola}(伐木人)酱同样相配。

\newpage
\section{Garganelli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81garganelli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Garganelli}
A(i,j) == (i-25.0)/125.0*j
B(i,j) == (i-25.0)/125.0*(150.0-j)
C(i,j) == _
  if ((j <= 75) or (i <= 25)) _
   then A(i,j) _
   else if ((J >= 75) or (i <= 25)) _
         then B(i,j) _
         else if ((j >= 75) or (i >= 25)) _
               then B(i,j) _
               else A(i,j)
X(i,j) == 0.1*cos(j*%pi/3)+(3+sin(C(i,j)*%pi/60))*cos(7*C(i,j)*%pi/60)
Y(i,j) == 0.1*sin(j*%pi/3)+(3+sin(C(i,j)*%pi/60))*sin(7*C(i,j)*%pi/60)
Z(i,j) == 6.0*j/25.0+C(i,j)/4.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..50,j=0..150,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Garganelli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
viewpoint(v3d,-5,0,0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl garganelli}是一种带凹槽的{\sl pasta corta}(短意面),外形与{\sl maccheroni}相近,但两端呈尖锐的斜切状,形似鸡的食道(在意大利北部的艾米利亚-罗马涅方言中被称作「{\sl garganel}」)。{\sl garganelli}传统上用清汤煮食,有时也会配野兔肉酱与碎培根一起上桌。

\newpage
\section{Gemelli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81gemelli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Gemelli}
X(i,j) == 6*cos(j*1.9*%pi/50+0.55*%pi)*cos(3.0*i/25.0)
Y(i,j) == 6*cos(j*1.9*%pi/50+0.55*%pi)*sin(3.0*i/25.0)
Z(i,j) == 8*sin(j*1.9*%pi/50+0.55*%pi)+3.0*i/4.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..100,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Gemelli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
要做出一根{\sl gemello},只需把单独一根面条拧成螺旋状,乍看却像是两根绞在一起。在意大利南部,{\sl gemelli}(双胞胎)常配番茄、马苏里拉奶酪与罗勒食用;而在西北部,人们更喜欢配香蒜酱和四季豆,或用来做沙拉。

\newpage
\section{Gigli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81gigli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Gigli}
X(i,j) == (0.8-0.6*sin(j*%pi/80)^0.5)*cos(i*%pi/50)+0.08*sin(j*%pi/40)
Y(i,j) == (0.8-0.6*sin(j*%pi/80)^0.5)*sin(i*%pi/50)+0.08*sin(j*%pi/40)
Z(i,j) == 1.1*j/40.0+0.7*(1-sin((150-i)*%pi/300))^2
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Gigli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl gigli}边缘呈波纹状,形似圆锥,看上去像小铃铛({\sl campanelle}),又像百合花({\sl gigli}),其名字正是由此而来。作为一种较晚近的设计,{\sl gigli}的形状很适合裹住浓稠的肉酱。

\newpage
\section{Giglio Ondulato}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81giglioondulato.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Giglio Ondulato}
A(i,j) == 0.6+0.03*((40.0-j)/40.0)^10*cos((4*i+75)*%pi/15) - _
          0.5*sin(j*%pi/80)^0.6
B(i,j) == sin(2*i*%pi/75)+(i/150.0)^10*(0.08*sin(j*%pi/40)+0.03*sin(j*%pi/5))
X(i,j) == A(i,j)*cos(2*i*%pi/75)+(i/150.0)^10 * _
          (0.08*sin(j*%pi/40)+0.03*cos(j*%pi/5))
Y(i,j) == (0.6+0.03*((40.0-j)/40.0)^10*sin(4*i*%pi/15)-0.5*sin(j*%pi/80)^0.6)*_
          B(i,j)
Z(i,j) == 1.1*j/40.0+0.7*(1-sin((150.0-i)*%pi/300.0))
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Giglio Ondulato")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl giglio ondulato}与{\sl gigli}几乎相同,只是边缘呈锯齿状的城垛形,同样以杜兰小麦粉和水制成。

\newpage
\section{Gnocchetti Sardi}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81gnocchettisardi.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Gnocchetti Sardi}
A(j)   == 0.8+3*sin(j*%pi/150)^0.8
B(i,j) == cos((2*j+7.5)*%pi/15)
X(i,j) == A(j)*cos(i*%pi/50)+0.2*cos(i*%pi/50)*sin(j*%pi/150)*B(i,j)
Y(i,j) == A(j)*sin(i*%pi/50)+0.2*sin(i*%pi/50)*sin(j*%pi/150)*B(i,j)
Z(i,j) == 13.0*cos(j*%pi/150)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..50,j=0..150,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Gnocchetti Sardi")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
正如其名所示,{\sl gnocchetti}就是小号的{\sl gnocchi}(即「小疙瘩」)。它们很适合配意大利乳清干酪(ricotta)或佩科里诺罗马诺(Pecorino Romano)干酪食用,也可以配小牛肉{\sl ragu}之类的浓稠酱汁。{\sl gnocchetti}发源于撒丁岛(Sardinia)——一座位于意大利以西的地中海岛屿。

\newpage
\section{Gnocchi}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81gnocchi.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Gnocchi}
A(i,j) == i/40.0*sin(j*%pi/130)
B(i,j) == abs(cos((j+13)*%pi/26))
X(i,j) == 0.2*cos(i*1.3*%pi/40)*sin(j*%pi/130)*B(i,j) + _
          A(i,j)*cos(i*1.3*%pi/40)
Y(i,j) == 0.2*sin(i*1.3*%pi/40)*sin(j*%pi/130)*B(i,j) + _
          A(i,j)*sin(i*1.3*%pi/40)
Z(i,j) == 1.5*cos(j*%pi/130)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..40,j=0..130,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Gnocchi")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl gnocchi}(疙瘩)是一个庞大家族的统称,外形常似半开的有槽贝壳。它们的做法与用料(包括土豆、杜兰小麦、荞麦和粗粒小麦粉)因种类而异。{\sl gnocchi}常常拌入丰提娜(fontina)干酪做的酱汁一起食用。

\newpage
\section{Gramigna}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81gramigna.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Gramigna}
X(i,j) == (0.5+5.6*(j/150.0)^2+0.3*cos(2*i*%pi/25))*cos(2.1*j*%pi/150)
Y(i,j) == 0.3*sin(2*i*%pi/25)
Z(i,j) == (0.5+3.2*(j/150.0)^2+0.3*cos(2*i*%pi/25))*sin(2.1*j*%pi/150)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..25,j=0..150,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Gramigna")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl gramigna}(小杂草)是意大利北部艾米利亚-罗马涅(Emilia-Romagna)大区的特产,传统上配香肠块酱汁食用,或搭配举世闻名的{\sl ragu alla bolognese}(博洛尼亚肉酱)。此外,{\sl gramigna}有时也会做成{\sl alla pomodoro}(清淡番茄酱)风味。

\newpage
\section{Lancette}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81lancette.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Lancette}
A(i,j) == 0.4*sin(5*j*%pi/9)
B(i,j) == sin((j+45)*%pi/90)
C(i,j) == (3.0*i-75.0)/5.0*sin(j*%pi/90)-(1-sin(i*%pi/50))^25*A(i,j)*B(i,j)
D(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 25) _
   then C(i,j) _
   else 30.0*(i-25.0)/50.0*sin(j*%pi/90)+sin((i-25)*%pi/50)*A(i,j)*B(i,j)
X(i,j) == 4*cos(3*D(i,j)*%pi/50)
Y(i,j) == 4*sin(3*D(i,j)*%pi/50)*(0.3+(1-sin(j*%pi/90))^0.6)
Z(i,j) == j/3.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..50,j=0..90,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Lancette")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl lancette}即「(钟表的)指针」之意,长度不超过 15 毫米,属于{\sl pastine minute}(迷你意面)家族。它们配清汤享用十分美味,再撒上一些烤面包丁和碎香草便更添风味。{\sl lancette}加入蘑菇汤或鸡汤中同样出色。

\newpage
\section{Lasagna Larga Doppia Riccia}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81lasagnalargadoppiariccia.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Lasagna Larga Doppia Riccia}
X(i,j) == _
  if ((8 <= i) and (i <= 42)) _
   then 5.0/6.0+(5.0*i-40.0)/34.0 _
   else if (i <= 8) _
         then 5.0*i/48.0 _
         else 5.0/6.0*(7+(i-42.0)/8)
Y(i,j) == j/15.0
Z(i,j) == _
  if ((8 <= i) and (i <= 42)) _
   then 0.0 _
   else if (i <= 8) _
         then (8.0-i)/32.0*cos((j+3)*%pi/6) _
         else 0.25*(i-42)/8.0*cos((j+9)*%pi/6)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..50,j=0..150,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Lasagna Larga Doppia Riccia")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
正如其名所示,{\sl lasagna larga doppia riccia}(宽幅双卷千层面)有两条长长的波浪状边缘。这些卷边让面片煮熟后口感富于变化,也更容易挂住酱汁。{\sl lasagne}配意大利乳清干酪与{\sl ragu napoletano}(那不勒斯肉酱)十分美味,也可以{\sl al forno}(入炉烘烤)配奶香{\sl besciamella}(白酱)食用。

\newpage
\section{Linguine}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81linguine.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Linguine}
X(i,j) == cos(i*%pi/75)
Y(i,j) == 2*sin(i*%pi/75)
Z(i,j) == j/5.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Linguine")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl linguine}(小舌头)是{\sl bavette}(小水滴)家族里最细的一员,最适合配新鲜番茄、香草、少许橄榄油、大蒜、鳀鱼和辣椒享用。{\sl linguine}也可以配贝类酱汁,或用奶油与软质干酪调制、再以柠檬、藏红花或姜调味的白酱。

\newpage
\section{Lumaconi Rigati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81lumaconirigati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Lumaconi Rigati}
A(i,j) == 0.45+0.01*cos(i*%pi/3)+j/300.0*abs(cos(i*%pi/240))*cos(i*%pi/120)^20
B(i,j) == j/300.0*abs(cos(i*%pi/240))*sin(i*%pi/120) + _
          0.125*(j/60.0)^6*sin(i*%pi/120)
X(i,j) == (0.4*cos(i*%pi/120)+A(i,j))*cos(j*%pi/60) + _
          0.48*(j/60.0)^6*sin((i+60)*%pi/120)^3
Y(i,j) == 0.5*sin(i*%pi/120)+0.01*sin(i*%pi/3)+B(i,j)
Z(i,j) == (0.45+0.4*cos(i*%pi/120))*sin(j*%pi/60)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..240,j=0..60,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Lumaconi Rigati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
rotate(v3d,90,180)
\end{chunk}
{\sl lumaconi rigati}(大号带槽蜗牛)最初来自坎帕尼亚(Campania)和利古里亚(Liguria),可以填入各式各样的馅料,包括菠菜和意大利乳清干酪。和意大利烤面卷(cannelloni)一样,填好馅后可以浇上{\sl besciamella}(白酱)放入烤箱烘烤。这个家族里还有个头更小的成员——{\sl lumache}。

\newpage
\section{Maccheroni}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81maccheroni.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Maccheroni}
X(i,j) == 8*cos(i*%pi/75)+0.2*cos(4*i*%pi/15)+5*cos(j*%pi/100)
Y(i,j) == 8*sin(i*%pi/75)+0.2*sin(4*i*%pi/15)+4*sin(j*%pi/100)
Z(i,j) == 6.0*j/5.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Maccheroni")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl maccheroni}这个名字的来历已不可考。它是一个统称,泛指用杜兰小麦粉、或许再加鸡蛋制成的空心{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)。这种意面可以做成{\sl con le sarde}(配沙丁鱼)——再加一点茴香提味,风味更佳。

\newpage
\section{Maccheroni Alla Chitarra}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81maccheroniallachitarra.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Maccheroni Alla Chitarra}
X(i,j) == 0.05*cos(i*%pi/60)^3 + 0.05*cos(i*%pi/60)
Y(i,j) == 0.05*sin(i*%pi/60)^3 + 0.05*sin(i*%pi/60)
Z(i,j) == j/60.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..120,j=0..60,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Maccheroni Alla Chitarra")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl maccheroni alla chitarra}(吉他{\sl maccheroni})来自意大利中部的阿布鲁佐(Abruzzo)大区,截面呈正方形——做法是把薄薄一张面皮压过一排排紧密排列的钢丝(即{\sl chitarra},意为「吉他」),其名字也由此而来。通常配羊肉{\sl ragu},或配{\sl pallottelle}(小牛肉丸)食用。

\newpage
\section{Mafaldine}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81mafaldine.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Mafaldine}
X(i,j) == 7.0*i/18.0
Y(i,j) == j/3.0
Z(i,j) == _
  if ((6 <= i) and (i <= 24)) _
   then 0.0 _
   else if (i <= 6) _
         then (6.0-i)/6.0*cos((j+5)*%pi/10) _
         else (i-24.0)/6.0*cos((j+15)*%pi/10)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..30,j=0..150,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Mafaldine")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl mafaldine}得名于二十世纪之交萨伏伊(Savoy)王室的 Mafalda 公主,是一种由杜兰小麦粉制成的薄面片,两条长边都做成波浪状。它们通常配{\sl ragu napoletano}(那不勒斯肉酱)之类的肉酱,或用于海鲜菜式。

\newpage
\section{Manicotti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81manicotti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Manicotti}
A(i,j) == -7*sin((i-100)*%pi/100)^2+0.3*sin((3*i-300)*%pi/10)
B(i,j) == -8*cos((i-100)*%pi/100)+0.3*cos((3*i-300)*%pi/10)
C(i,j) == -8*cos((i-100)*%pi/100)+22*sin((j-20)*%pi/40)
X(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 7*sin(i*%pi/100)^2+0.3*sin(3*i*%pi/10) _
   else A(i,j)
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 8*cos(i*%pi/100)+0.3*cos(3*i*%pi/10) _
   else B(i,j)
Z(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 8*cos(i*%pi/100)+22*sin((j-20)*%pi/40) _
   else C(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Manicotti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl manicotti}(袖子)是已知历史最悠久的杜兰小麦意面品种之一,最初的做法是把面团切成长方形,铺上馅料后卷起来,最后{\sl al forno}(入炉烘烤)。如今它们常常填入各式干酪,再浇上一层咸香酱汁,吃起来就像加了馅的正餐可丽饼。

\newpage
\section{Orecchiette}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81orecchiette.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Orecchiette}
X(i,j) == 2.0*j/3.0*cos(i*%pi/75)+0.3*cos(2*i*%pi/15)
Y(i,j) == 10*sin(i*%pi/75)
Z(i,j) == 0.1*cos(i*%pi/3)+5*(0.5+0.5*cos(2*i*%pi/75))^4*cos(j*%pi/30)^2 + _
          1.5*(0.5+0.5*cos(2*i*%pi/75))^5*sin(j*%pi/30)^10
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..15,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Orecchiette")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
这种意面在意大利东南沿海的普利亚(Puglia)大区颇受欢迎,当地惯常将它与西兰花薹(rapini,西兰花的近亲,当地盛产)同煮。{\sl orecchiette}(小耳朵)也很适合配豆类等其他蔬菜,以及鳀鱼、酸豆或橄榄之类的咸味调味料。

\newpage
\section{Paccheri}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81paccheri.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Paccheri}
X(i,j) == (j+60.0)/60.0*cos(i*%pi/75)+0.5*cos(j*%pi/60)+cos((i+j)*%pi/75)
Y(i,j) == 2.6*sin(i*%pi/75)+0.3*sin(j*%pi/60)
Z(i,j) == 7.0*j/30.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..30,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Paccheri")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl paccheri}属于{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族,是一种带槽的圆柱形意面,由于个头较大,适合配茄子、海鲜,乃至任何口感厚实的酱汁。据认为其名字源自{\sl paccare}一词,在意大利南部坎帕尼亚(Campania)方言里意为「拍打」。

\newpage
\section{Pappardelle}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81pappardelle.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Pappardelle}
A(i,j) == cos(i*%pi/80)+(3.0*j)/50.0*sin(21*i*%pi/800)
B(i,j) == sin(i*%pi/3200)^0.1*sin(i*%pi/80)
C(i,j) == 3.0*j/50.0+0.5*sin(i*%pi/200)
D(i,j) == cos(i*%pi/80)+3.0*j/50.0*sin(21*i*%pi/800)
E(i,j) == sin(i*%pi/3200)^0.5*sin(i*%pi/80)
F(i,j) == 3.0*j/50.0+0.5*sin(i*%pi/200)
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(A(i,j),B(i,j),C(i,j)),i=0..800,j=0..5,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(0.6*D(i,j),0.8*E(i,j),0.9*F(i,j)),i=0..800,j=0..5,_
           space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Pappardelle")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
\end{chunk}
这种{\sl pasta lunga}(长意面)常与鸭肉、鸽肉或其他野禽同煮。{\sl pappardelle}如此受欢迎,以至于意大利各地城镇都会为它举办节庆,例如意大利中部托雷阿尔菲纳(Torre Alfina)的{\sl Sagra delle Pappardelle al Cinghiale}(野猪{\sl pappardelle}节)。

\newpage
\section{Penne Rigate}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81pennerigate.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Penne Rigate}
X(i,j) == _
  if (i < 85) _
   then 4*sin(i*%pi/85)^2+0.1*sin(6*i*%pi/17) _
   else -4*sin((i-85)*%pi/85)^2+0.1*sin(6*(i-85)*%pi/17)
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i < 85) _
   then 4*cos(i*%pi/85)+0.1*cos(6*i*%pi/17) _
   else -4*cos((i-85)*%pi/85)+0.1*cos(6*(i-85)*%pi/17)
Z(i,j) == _
  if (i < 85) _
   then 7*cos(i*%pi/85)+15*sin((j-20)*%pi/40) _
   else -7*cos((i-85)*%pi/85)+15*sin((j-20)*%pi/40)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..170,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Penne Rigate")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl penne rigate}(有槽羽管面)是一种用途广泛的意面,来自意大利南部的坎帕尼亚(Campania),属于{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族。它们可以配辛辣的{\sl arrabbiata}(「发怒」)酱食用,这个名字正是源自其中所含的辣椒与红甜椒。

\newpage
\section{Pennoni Lisci}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81pennonilisci.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Pennoni Lisci}
X(i,j) == _ 
  if (i < 100) _
   then 7*sin(i*%pi/100)^2 _
   else -7*sin((i-100)*%pi/100)^2
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 8*cos(i*%pi/100) _
   else -8*cos((i-100)*%pi/100)
Z(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 12*cos(i*%pi/100)+15*sin((j-20)*%pi/40) _
   else -12*cos((i-100)*%pi/100)+15*sin((j-20)*%pi/40)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Pennoni Lisci")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl pennoni}(大羽管面)外观与{\sl penne rigate}相似,但个头更大且没有凹槽,需要更油润的酱汁(或许加入切片的西班牙香肠)才能挂在它们光滑的表面上。

\newpage
\section{Pennoni Rigati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81pennonirigati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Pennoni Rigati}
A(i,j) == -7*sin((i-100)*%pi/100)^2+0.2*sin((3*i-300)*%pi/10)
B(i,j) == -8*cos((i-100)*%pi/100)+0.2*cos((3*i-300)*%pi/10)
C(i,j) == -12*cos((i-100)*%pi/100)+15*sin((j-20)*%pi/40)
X(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 7*sin(i*%pi/100)^2+0.15*sin(3*i*%pi/10) _
   else A(i,j)
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 8*cos(i*%pi/100)+0.15*cos(3*i*%pi/10) _
   else B(i,j)
Z(i,j) == _
  if (i < 100) _
   then 12*cos(i*%pi/100)+15*sin((j-20)*%pi/40) _
   else C(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Pennoni Rigati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl penne}意面家族那斜切的两端,让人一眼就能认出它的成员。{\sl pennoni rigati}(大号有槽羽管面)是{\sl pennoni}的带槽版本,可以填馅后烹煮。

\newpage
\section{Puntalette}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81puntalette.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Puntalette}
X(i,j) == 1.4*sin(j*%pi/80)^1.2*cos(i*%pi/40)
Y(i,j) == 2.5*sin(j*%pi/80)^1.2*sin(i*%pi/40)
Z(i,j) == 8*cos(j*%pi/80)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..80,j=0..80,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Puntalette")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl puntalette}(小尖头)是{\sl pastine minute}(迷你意面)家族的又一成员,长约 9 毫米,厚度不超过 3 毫米。和大多数{\sl pastine}一样,它们最适合放进奶香浓汤,或者用来做沙拉。

\newpage
\section{Quadrefiore}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81quadrefiore.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Quadrefiore}
X(i,j) == 2*cos(i*%pi/250)*(abs(sin(3*i*%pi/250)))^20 + _
          (0.6+0.9*sin(j*%pi/50))*cos(i*%pi/250)+0.2*cos(4*j*%pi/25)
Y(i,j) == 2*sin(i*%pi/250)*(abs(sin(3*i*%pi/250)))^20 + _
          (0.6+0.9*sin(j*%pi/50))*sin(i*%pi/250)+1.5*sin(j*%pi/50)
Z(i,j) == 3.0*j/10.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..500,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Quadrefiore")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl quadrefiori}(方形花朵)是{\sl pasta corta}(短意面)里较少见的一种,质地厚实,沿其长度方向带有波浪状的边缘。生产商与经销商 Francis Ford Coppola 采用古董青铜模具和木制晾架,以求做出原汁原味的形态与口感。

\newpage
\section{Quadretti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81quadretti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Quadretti}
X(i,j) == 3.0*i/14.0
Y(i,j) == 3.0*j/14.0
Z(i,j) == 0.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..70,j=0..70,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Quadretti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,1.5,1.5,1.5)
\end{chunk}
这种扁平的形状用杜兰小麦粉、鸡蛋、甚至肉豆蔻制成。{\sl quadretti}(小方块)是一种经典的{\sl pastine},做法是利用较大面片裁剪后剩下的边角料,可以作为传统鱼汤的一部分,或加入蚕豆汤中。由于形状小,只需煮很短的时间即可。

\newpage
\section{Racchette}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81racchette.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Racchette}
A(i)    == sin(i*%pi/2000)^0.5
X0(i,j) == 2*cos((i+1500)*%pi/1500)+0.65*cos((i+750)*%pi/1500) + _
           2*(abs(cos(i*%pi/300)))^100*cos(i*%pi/1500)
Y0(i,j) == 2.4*sin((i+1500)*%pi/1500)+0.1*sin(i*%pi/1500) + _
           2.3*(abs(sin(i*%pi/300)))^100*sin(i*%pi/1500)
X1(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 2000) _
   then 2.1*cos((2*A(i)+1)*%pi)+0.65*cos((2*A(i)+0.5)*%pi)+_
        2.5*sin((A(i)+1.83)*%pi)^500 _
   else -2.1
Y1(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 2000) _
   then 2.5*sin((2*A(i)+1)*%pi)+0.1*sin(A(i)*2*%pi)+_
        3*sin((A(i)+1.83)*%pi)^500 _
   else 0.0
Z(i,j) == j/4.0
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X0(i,j),Y0(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..3000,j=0..4,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X1(i,j),Y1(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..3000,j=0..4,space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Racchette")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
\end{chunk}
{\sl racchette}(球拍)通常拌入沙拉食用,搭配香脆的松子、芦笋片和新鲜豌豆恰到好处。此外,加入西瓜丁或石榴籽,也能做成一道清爽可口的小食。

\newpage
\section{Radiatori}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81radiatori.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Radiatori}
X(i,j) == (1.5+3*(i/70.0)^5+4*sin(j*%pi/200)^50)*cos(4*i*%pi/175)
Y(i,j) == (1.5+3*(i/70.0)^5+4*sin(j*%pi/200)^50)*sin(4*i*%pi/175)
Z(i,j) == j/50.0+cos(3*i*%pi/14)*sin(j*%pi/1000)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..70,j=0..1000,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Radiatori")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl radiatori}(暖气片)形状小巧敦实,因边缘褶皱形似暖气片散热片而得名。煮熟沥干、作为 {\sl pastasciutta}(煮沥意面)食用时,其中空的中心与较大的表面积能很好地挂住浓稠的酱汁,褶皱边缘还能兜住细小的食物碎屑。这种面食常搭配以羊肉、小牛肉、兔肉或猪肉为底的 {\sl ragu}(肉酱)。

\newpage
\section{Ravioli Quadrati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81ravioliquadrati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Ravioli Quadrati}
X(i,j) == i/2.0+0.4*sin((j+2.5)*%pi/5) * _
          (sin(i*%pi/200)^0.2 - cos(i*%pi/200)^0.2)
Y(i,j) == j/2.0+0.4*sin((11*i+25)*%pi/50) * _
          (sin(j*%pi/200)^0.2 - cos(j*%pi/200)^0.2)
Z(i,j) == _
  if (((10 < j) and (j < 90)) or ((10 < i) and (i < 90))) _
   then 10*sin((i-10)*%pi/80)^0.6*sin((j-10)*%pi/80)^0.6 _
   else if ((10 > j) or (10 > i)) _
         then 0.0 _
         else 0.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..99,j=0..99,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Ravioli Quadrati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
除了方形轮廓外,{\sl ravioli quadrati}(方形云吞)与 {\sl ravioli tondi}(圆形 {\sl ravioli})的做法完全相同。这一主题还有其他变体,如新月形、三角形和心形。关于 {\sl ravioli} 这个名字的来源,有人认为源自意思是"包裹"的动词,也有人将其与意大利语中意为"芜菁"的 {\sl rapa} 一词联系起来。

\newpage
\section{Ravioli Tondi}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81raviolitondi.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Ravioli Tondi}
X(i,j) == 5.0*i/8.0+0.5*sin((j+2)*%pi/4) * _
          (sin(i*%pi/160)^0.2-cos(i*%pi/160)^0.2)
Y(i,j) == 5.0*j/8.0+0.5*sin((i+2)*%pi/4) * _
          (sin(j*%pi/160)^0.2-cos(j*%pi/160)^0.2)
Z(i,j) == _
  if (600 >= ((i-40)^2+(j-40)^2)) _
   then 0.5*sqrt(600 - (i-40)^2-(j-40)^2) _
   else 0.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..80,j=0..80,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Ravioli Tondi")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl ravioli tondi}(圆形 {\sl ravioli})是迄今为止最著名的 {\sl pasta ripiena}(酿馅意面),做法是把馅料封在两层小麦粉和鸡蛋做的面皮之间。馅料的种类极为丰富,从奢华的肉类与奶酪搭配,到更为清淡的蘑菇、菠菜乃至荨麻馅心不等。

\newpage
\section{Riccioli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81riccioli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Riccioli}
X(i,j) == (2+8*sin(i*%pi/100)+9*sin((11*j+100)*%pi/400)^2)*cos(4*i*%pi/125)
Y(i,j) == (2+8*sin(i*%pi/100)+9*sin((11*j+100)*%pi/400)^2)*sin(4*i*%pi/125)
Z(i,j) == j/4.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..50,j=0..200,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Riccioli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl riccioli}(卷儿)是知名的 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面),起源于意大利北部的艾米利亚-罗马涅大区。其外表带棱纹、内部中空的形状,使 {\sl riccioli} 能挂住大量酱汁。

\newpage
\section{Riccioli al Cinque Sapori}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81ricciolialcinquesapori.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Riccioli al Cinque Sapori}
X(i,j) == 1.5*cos(i*%pi/20)*(1+0.5*sin(j*%pi/25)*sin(i*%pi/40) + _
          0.43*sin((j+18.75)*%pi/25)*cos(i*%pi/40))+2*cos(j*%pi/50)
Y(i,j) == 1.5*sin(i*%pi/20)^3+cos(j*%pi/25)
Z(i,j) == sin(j*%pi/100)+20*cos(j*%pi/200)^2
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..20,j=0..100,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Riccioli al Cinque Sapori")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl riccioli} 与 {\sl riccioli al cinque sapori}(五味卷儿)都属于 {\sl pasta corta}(小型意面)家族,但二者在结构上并无相似之处。{\sl riccioli al cinque sapori} 用杜兰小麦粉制成,颜色则来自加入的菠菜、番茄、甜菜根和姜黄,通常配汤食用。

\newpage
\section{Rigatoni}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81rigatoni.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Rigatoni}
X(i,j) == 0.2*sin((7*i+15)*%pi/30)+2*cos((j+60)*%pi/120) + _
          (7+(60-j)/60.0*sin(i*%pi/240))*cos(i*%pi/120)
Y(i,j) == 0.2*sin(7*i*%pi/30)+(8+0.1*(60-j)/60+j/30*cos(i*%pi/240)) * _
          sin(i*%pi/120)
Z(i,j) == j/2.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..240,j=0..60,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Rigatoni")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl rigatoni}(大棱纹管)是 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面)分支的一员,原产于意大利南部,用途十分广泛。其厚实的形状能很好地挂住奶油或番茄酱汁,但 {\sl rigatoni} 最适合搭配香肠、野味肉、蘑菇和黑胡椒同食。

\newpage
\section{Rombi}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81rombi.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Rombi}
X(i,j) == _
  if ((13 <= i) and (i <= 37)) _
    then i/20.0+j/25.0-1/20.0 _
    else if (i <= 13) _
          then 3.0*i/65.0+j/25.0 _
          else 6/65.0+3.0*i/65.0+j/25.0
Y(i,j) == j/25.0
Z(i,j) == _
  if ((13 <= i) and (i <= 37)) _
   then 0.0 _
   else if (i <= 13) _
         then 0.2*((13.0-i)/13.0)*cos((2.0*j+12.5)*%pi/25) _
         else (i-37.0)/65.0*cos((2.0*j+37.5)*%pi/25)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..50,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Rombi")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl rombi}(菱形)是一种不太为人所知的 {\sl pasta corta},像 {\sl lasagna doppia riccia} 一样带有两条卷边,不过体形更小,且沿对角线切裁。通常根据大小的不同,或拌酱作 {\sl pastasciutta} 食用,或配 {\sl brodo}(清汤)上桌。

\newpage
\section{Rotelle}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81rotelle.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Rotelle}
X0(i,j) == 0.5*cos(i*%pi/1000)+1.5*(abs(sin(3*i*%pi/1000)))^50*cos(i*%pi/1000)
Y0(i,j) == 0.5*sin(i*%pi/1000)+1.5*(abs(sin(3*i*%pi/1000)))^50*sin(i*%pi/1000)
X1(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 666) _
   then 2*cos(3*i*%pi/1000)+0.03*cos(93*i*%pi/1000) _
   else 2.03
Y1(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 666) _
   then 2.05*sin(3*i*%pi/1000)+0.03*sin(93*i*%pi/1000) _
   else 0.0
Z(i,j) == j/5.0
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X0(i,j),Y0(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..2000,j=0..5,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X1(i,j),Y1(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..2000,j=0..5,space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Rotelle")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
\end{chunk}
{\sl rotelle}(小轮子)是 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族中较为新奇的一支现代设计,带辐条的构造有助于兜住各种风味,使其能与多种酱汁很好地搭配。较小的版本可拌入沙拉,或煮入汤中食用。

\newpage
\section{Saccottini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81saccottini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Saccottini}
X(i,j) == cos(i*%pi/75)*(sin(j*%pi/50)+1.3*sin(j*%pi/200) + _
          3*j/1000.0*cos((i+25)*%pi/25))
Y(i,j) == sin(i*%pi/75)*(sin(j*%pi/50)+1.3*sin(j*%pi/200) + _
          0.7*(j/100.0)^2*sin(i*%pi/15))
Z(i,j) == 2*(1-(abs(cos(j*%pi/200)))^5+(j/100.0)^4.5)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..100,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Saccottini")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl saccottini} 是 {\sl pasta ripiena}(酿馅意面)大家族里又一个不折不扣的成员——与之关系密切的还有 {\sl fagottini}——做法是把一张圆形杜兰小麦面皮收拢成一个不规则的球状小包。{\sl saccottini} 通常填入意大利乳清干酪(ricotta)、肉或清蒸的青菜。

\newpage
\section{Sagnarelli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81sagnarelli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Sagnarelli}
A(i) == 0.5*sin((i+1.5)*%pi/3)
B(i) == 0.05*sin((9*i+12.5)*%pi/25)
X(i,j) == i/10.0+A(j)*(cos(i*%pi/120)^100-sin(i*%pi/200)^100)
Y(i,j) == j/20.0+B(i)*(cos(j*%pi/120)^100-sin(j*%pi/200)^100)
Z(i,j) == 0.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..100,j=0..60,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Sagnarelli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
这种短小的长方形面带四边带有锯齿状凹口,属于 {\sl pasta lunga}(长意面)分支。{\sl sagnarelli} 有时会加鸡蛋制作,通常作 {\sl pastasciutta} 配肉 {\sl ragu}(肉酱)食用,或搭配野生芦笋一类的蔬菜。

\newpage
\section{Sagne Incannulate}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81sagneincannulate.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Sagne Incannulate}
X0(i,j) == (1-0.2*sin(3*j*%pi/20))*cos((i+10)*%pi/20) + _
           2*sin((i-100)*%pi/200)+(3*i)/200.0*sin(i*%pi/400)^200
Y0(i,j) == (1-0.2*sin(3*j*%pi/20))*sin((i+10)*%pi/20)+sin((i-50)/200*%pi)
X1(i,j) == -3+(1-0.1*sin(3*j*%pi/20))*sin((3*i-10)*%pi/50) + _
           cos(i*%pi/200)+3*i/200.0*sin(i*%pi/400)^5
Y1(i,j) == -5+(1-01.*sin(3*j*%pi/20))*cos((3*i+10)*%pi/50)+2*sin(i*%pi/200)
Z(i,j) == i/4.0+7/2.0*(1+cos(j*%pi/20))
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X0(i,j),Y0(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..20,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X1(i,j),Y1(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..200,j=0..20,space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Sagne Incannulate")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
zoom(vp,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
制作这种名为 {\sl sagne incannulate} 的杜兰小麦扭纹面带需要一定手艺。做法是一只手把面条的一端按在木板上固定,另一只手掌搓动 {\sl pasta lunga}(长意面)的其余部分,搓出其独特的卷曲。{\sl sagne} 最适合搭配浓稠的酱汁或传统 {\sl ragu}(肉酱)食用。

\newpage
\section{Scialatielli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81scialatielli.eps}}}
猪肉或小牛肉 {\sl ragu}(肉酱)。
\begin{chunk}{Scialatielli}
X(i,j) == 0.1*cos(i*%pi/75)+0.1*cos((i+7.5)*%pi/75)^3+0.1*sin(j*%pi/50)
Y(i,j) == 0.1*cos(i*%pi/75)+0.2*sin(i*%pi/75)^3+0.1*sin(j*%pi/50)
Z(i,j) == 3.0*j/50.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Scialatielli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl scialatielli} 来自那不勒斯省的阿马尔菲海岸,是一种朴实的 {\sl pasta lunga}(长意面),外观与 {\sl fettuccine} 及 {\sl tagliotelle} 相近。制作时可在杜兰小麦粉中加入牛奶和鸡蛋,赋予面条金黄的色泽,{\sl scialatielli} 最适合搭配海鲜,或

\newpage
\section{Spaccatelle}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81spaccatelle.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Spaccatelle}
X(i,j) == (0.5+5*(j/100.0)^3+0.5*cos((i+37.5)*%pi/25))*cos(2*j*%pi/125)
Y(i,j) == 0.6*sin((i+37.5)*%pi/25)
Z(i,j) == (0.5+5*(j/100.0)^3+0.5*cos((i+37.5)*%pi/25))*sin(2*j*%pi/125)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..25,j=0..100,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Spaccatelle")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
这种西西里名产属于 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族。{\sl spaccatelle} 通常呈中部凹陷的细长弧形,作 {\sl pastasciutta}(煮沥意面)食用时,配清淡的番茄酱或浓郁的肉 {\sl ragu}(肉酱)。

\newpage
\section{Spaghetti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81spaghetti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Spaghetti}
X(i,j) == 0.1*cos(i*%pi/20)
Y(i,j) == 0.1*sin(i*%pi/20)
Z(i,j) == j/10.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..40,j=0..100,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Spaghetti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
毫无疑问,{\sl spaghetti}(细线)仍是全世界最知名、用途最广的 {\sl pasta lunga}(长意面)。它们最为人称道的,是搭配 {\sl ragu bolognese}(博洛尼亚肉酱)——一种由牛肉、番茄、奶油、洋葱和意式培根(pancetta)调制而成的混合酱料。近年来,{\sl spaghetti} 在奶香浓郁的 {\sl carbonara}(培根蛋酱面)中也大受欢迎。

\newpage
\section{Spiralli}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81spiralli.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Spiralli}
X(i,j) == (2.5+2*cos(i*%pi/50)+0.1*cos(i*%pi/5))*cos(j*%pi/30)
Y(i,j) == (2.5+2*cos(i*%pi/50)+0.1*cos(i*%pi/5))*sin(j*%pi/30)
Z(i,j) == (2.5+2*sin(i*%pi/50)+0.1*sin(i*%pi/5))+j/6.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..100,j=0..120,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Spiralli")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
带棱纹的螺旋状 {\sl spirali}(螺旋)在形状上与 {\sl cavatappi} 相近,只是略大一些。{\sl spirali} 可拌浓稠酱汁作 {\sl pastasciutta} 食用,也可 {\sl al forno}(烤箱烘烤)、铺上厚厚一层奶酪烤制,或加入沙拉。

\newpage
\section{Stellette}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81stellette.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Stellette}
X(i,j) == (3.0+3.0*i/5.0)*cos(j*%pi/75)+i/10*cos((j+15)*%pi/15)
Y(i,j) == (3.0+3.0*i/5.0)*sin(j*%pi/75)+i/10*sin(j*%pi/15)
Z(i,j) == 0.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..25,j=0..150,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Stellette")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
{\sl stellette}(小星星)是 {\sl pastine minute}(微型意面)家族的一员,体形只比 {\sl acini di pepe} 和 {\sl cuoretti} 稍大一点。和所有 {\sl pastine} 一样,它们最适合放入清淡的汤中食用,或许还可以用大褐菇(portobello)或豌豆调味。

\newpage
\section{Stortini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81stortini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Stortini}
A(i,j) == 0.5*(abs(sin(2*i*%pi/125)))^3
B(i,j) == 1-abs(sin((2*i-500)*%pi/125))
C(i,j) == 1-0.5*(abs(sin(2*(i-375)*%pi/125)))^3
X(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 250) _
   then cos(2*i*%pi/125) _
   else 1.7-cos((2*i-500)*%pi/125)
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 250) _
   then if (i <= 125) _
         then abs(sin(2*i*%pi/125)) _
         else A(i,j) _
   else if (i <= 375) _
         then B(i,j) _
         else C(i,j)
Z(i,j) == j/20.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..500,j=0..10,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Stortini")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl stortini}(小弯条)是另一种 {\sl pastine minute}(微型意面),常配蘑菇和芹菜放入奶香浓汤食用。一般来说,较小的意面适合较稀的汤,而较大的 {\sl pastina minute} 则可搭配较浓稠的品种。

\newpage
\section{Strozzapreti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81strozzapreti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Strozzapreti}
A(i,j) == 0.5*cos(j*%pi/40)+0.5*cos((j+76)*%pi/40) + _
          0.5*cos(j*%pi/30)+0.5*sin((2*i-j)*%pi/40)
B(i,j) == 0.5*sin(j*%pi/40)+0.5*sin((j+76)*%pi/40) + _
          0.5*sin(j*%pi/30)+0.5*cos((2*i-j)*%pi/40)
X(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 30) _
   then 0.5*cos(j*%pi/30)+0.5*cos((2*i+j+16)*%pi/40) _
   else A(i,j)
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 30) _
   then 0.5*sin(j*%pi/30)+0.5*sin((2*i+j+16)*%pi/40) _
   else B(i,j)
Z(i,j) == j/4.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..60,j=0..60,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Strozzapreti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
用来制作 {\sl strozzapreti}(或称 {\sl strangolapreti};两者都意为"扼杀神父者")的面团,可以用各种面粉、鸡蛋乃至土豆调制而成。{\sl strozzapreti} 是理想的 {\sl pastasciutta},可配传统肉酱食用,再撒上帕尔玛干酪(Parmigiano-Reggiano)。

\newpage
\section{Tagliatelle}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81tagliatelle.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Tagliatelle}
X0(i,j) == 0.4*cos(3*i*%pi/250)+j/80.0*sin(31*i*%pi/1000)
Y0(i,j) == 0.4*sin(3*i*%pi/250)*sin(i*%pi/4000)^0.1
Z0(i,j) == j/80.0+0.12*sin(9*i*%pi/1000)
X1(i,j) == 0.4*cos(3*i*%pi/250)+j/80.0*sin(31*i*%pi/1000)
Y1(i,j) == 0.4*sin(i*%pi/4000)^0.5*sin(3*i*%pi/250)
Z1(i,j) == j/80.0+0.12*sin(9*i*%pi/1000)
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X0(i,j),Y0(i,j),Z0(i,j)),i=0..1000,j=0..4,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(0.8*X1(i,j),Y1(i,j),0.9*Z1(i,j)),i=0..1000,j=0..4,_
           space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X1(i,j),0.9*Y1(i,j),0.6*Z1(i,j)),i=0..1000,j=0..4,_
           space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Tagliatelle")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
\end{chunk}
{\sl tagliatelle}(得名于意大利语动词 {\sl tagliare}——"切")由小麦粉与鸡蛋调制而成,属于 {\sl pasta lunga}(长意面)家族。它原产于意大利北部,常配 {\sl carbonara}(培根蛋酱)食用,也可搭配海鲜,或者作为 {\sl timballo}(意式烤面食)的基底。

\newpage
\section{Taglierini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81taglierini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Taglierini}
X0(i,j) == 0.5*cos(i*%pi/100)+0.05*cos(i*%pi/40)
Y0(i,j) == 0.5*sin(i*%pi/4000)^0.1*sin(i*%pi/100)+0.075*sin(i*%pi/40)
Z0(i,j) == 3.0*j/200.0+0.1*sin(i*%pi/125)
X1(i,j) == 0.4*cos(i*%pi/100)
Y1(i,j) == 0.4*sin(i*%pi/4000)^0.2*sin(i*%pi/100)
Z1(i,j) == 3.0*j/200.0+0.1*sin(i*%pi/125)
X2(i,j) == 0.3*cos(i*%pi/100)
Y2(i,j) == 0.3*sin(3*i*%pi/1000)*sin(i*%pi/50)
Z2(i,j) == -0.05+3.0*j/200.0+0.1*sin(i*%pi/125)
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X0(i,j)*0.6,Y0(i,j)*0.5,Z0(i,j)),i=0..1000,j=0..2,_
           space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X1(i,j),Y1(i,j),Z1(i,j)),i=0..1000,j=0..2,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(0.8*X1(i,j),0.9*Y1(i,j),1.3*Z1(i,j)),i=0..1000,j=0..2,_
           space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X2(i,j),0.9*Y2(i,j),1.5*Z2(i,j)),i=0..1000,j=0..2,_
           space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Taglierini")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
\end{chunk}
{\sl taglierini} 是另一种卷曲的 {\sl pasta lunga}(长意面),与 {\sl tagliatelle} 同属一脉,但要窄得多——几乎细如发丝。

\newpage
\section{Tagliolini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81tagliolini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Tagliolini}
X0(i,j) == 0.5*cos(i*%pi/200)+0.05*cos(5*i*%pi/400)
Y0(i,j) == 0.5*sin(i*%pi/8000)^0.1*sin(i*%pi/200)+0.075*sin(5*i*%pi/400)
Z0(i,j) == 0.01*j+0.1*sin(i*%pi/250)
X1(i,j) == 0.4*cos(i*%pi/200)
Y1(i,j) == 0.4*sin(i*%pi/8000)^0.2*sin(i*%pi/200)
Z1(i,j) == 0.01*j+0.1*sin(i*%pi/250)
X2(i,j) == 0.3*cos(i*%pi/125)
Y2(i,j) == 0.3*sin(3*i*%pi/2000)*sin(3*i*%pi/200)
Z2(i,j) == -0.05+0.01*j+0.1*sin(i*%pi/250)
vsp:=createThreeSpace()
makeObject(surface(X0(i,j)*0.6,Y0(i,j)*0.5,Z0(i,j)),i=0..2000,j=0..1,_
           space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X1(i,j),Y1(i,j),Z1(i,j)),i=0..2000,j=0..2,space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(0.8*X1(i,j),0.9*Y1(i,j),1.3*Z1(i,j)),i=0..2000,j=0..2,_
           space==vsp)
makeObject(surface(X2(i,j),0.9*Y2(i,j),1.5*Z2(i,j)),i=0..2000,j=0..2,_
           space==vsp)
vp:=makeViewport3D(vsp,style=="smooth",title=="Tagliolini")
colorDef(vp,yellow(),yellow())
axes(vp,"off")
\end{chunk}
{\sl tagliolini} 比 {\sl taglierini} 还要细,传统上作为开胃菜食用,配黄油、软质奶酪,或 {\sl al pomodoro}(清淡番茄酱)。也可以配鸡汤食用。{\sl tagliolini} 用途广泛,还是多种 {\sl al forno}(烤箱烘烤)的 {\sl timballo} 菜肴的主要食材。

\newpage
\section{Torchietti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81torchietti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Torchietti}
A(i,j) == (3.0*i-60.0)*j/100.0
B(i,j) == (3.0*i-60.0)*(100.0-j)/100.0
C(i,j) == 3.0*(i-20.0)*(100.0-j)/100.0
D(i,j) == 3.0*(i-20.0)*j/100.0
E(i,j) == _
  if ((j <= 50) or (i <= 20)) _
   then A(i,j) _
   else if ((j >= 50) or (i <= 20)) _
         then B(i,j) _
         else if ((j >= 50) or (i >= 20)) _
               then C(i,j) _
               else D(i,j)
F(i,j) == (3+2.5*sin(E(i,j)*%pi/120)+3*sin(j*%pi/200)^10)
X(i,j) == F(i,j)*cos(E(i,j)*%pi/10)+0.1*cos(j*%pi/2)
Y(i,j) == F(i,j)*sin(E(i,j)*%pi/10)+0.1*sin(j*%pi/2)+3*sin(j*%pi/50)
Z(i,j) == 18.0*j/25.0+2.0*E(i,j)/5.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..40,j=0..100,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Torchietti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl torchietti}(小火把)的螺旋纹路能很好地兜住浓稠的酱汁。它们又称 {\sl maccheroni al torchio},最适合配番茄酱食用,再搭配胡萝卜、西兰花、菜花等切成大块的蔬菜。

\newpage
\section{Tortellini}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81tortellini.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Tortellini}
A(i,j) == 0.2*sin(i*%pi/200)+j/400.0
B(i,j) == cos(j/60.0*(2.7+0.2*sin(i*%pi/120)^50)*%pi+1.4*%pi)
C(i,j) == sin(j/60.0*(2.7+0.2*sin(i*%pi/120)^50)*%pi+1.4*%pi)
X(i,j) == 0.5^(1+0.5*sin(i*%pi/120))*cos((11*i-60)*%pi/600) * _
          (1.35+(3+sin(i*%pi/120))*A(i,j)*B(i,j))
Y(i,j) == 0.5*sin((11*i-60)*%pi/600) * _
          (1.35+(0.6+sin(i*%pi/120))*A(i,j)*B(i,j))
Z(i,j) == 0.15+i/1200.0+0.5*(0.8*sin(i*%pi/120)+j/400.0)*sin(i*%pi/120)*C(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..120,j=0..60,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Tortellini")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
\end{chunk}
制作一枚 {\sl tortellino} 时,先用一小勺肉、奶酪或蔬菜作馅,包入一层小麦粉与鸡蛋做的面皮,再手法娴熟地卷起、折叠。这些造型精巧的 {\sl pasta ripiena}(酿馅意面)家族成员,传统上放入热气腾腾的汤中食用,但也可沥干后配当地酱汁作 {\sl pastasciutta} 食用。

\newpage
\section{Tortiglioni}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81tortiglioni.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Tortiglioni}
X(i,j) == 6*cos(i*%pi/75)-3.5*cos(j*%pi/100) + _
          0.15*sin((13*i/75.0+j/15.0+1.5)*%pi)
Y(i,j) == 6*sin(i*%pi/75)+0.15*sin((13*i/75.0+j/15.0)*%pi)
Z(i,j) == 11.0*j/10.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Tortiglioni")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl tortiglioni} 是另一种经典的 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面),原产于意大利南部的坎帕尼亚大区。{\sl tortiglioni}(得名于意大利语 {\sl torquere}——"切")常被烤入 {\sl timballo},或煮熟沥干后作 {\sl pastasciutta} 食用,搭配番茄、辣味香肠(chorizo)和黑胡椒调制的浓郁酱汁。

\newpage
\section{Trenne}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81trenne.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Trenne}
X(i,j) == _
  (if (i <= 33) _
    then (3.0*i/10.0) _
     else ((300.0-3*i)/20.0))
Y(i,j) == _
 (if (i <= 33) _
   then (0.0) _
    else (if (i <= 66) _
           then ((9*i-300)/20.0) _
            else ((900-9*i)/20.0)))
Z(i,j) == _
 (if (i <= 33) _
   then (if (i <= 16) _
          then (-9.0*i/50.0+6.0*j/4.0) _
           else (-6.0+9.0*i/50.0+3.0*j/2.0) ) _
    else (if (i <= 66) _
           then (-12.0+7.0*i/20.0+6.0*j/4.0) _
            else (35.0-7.0*i/20.0+6.0*j/4.0)))
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..100,j=0..40,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Trenne")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,4.0,4.0,4.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl trenne}(横截面为三角形的 {\sl penne})是 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面)中一种中空的三角形品种,质地非常坚实。最适合搭配蘑菇、番茄和菠菜食用——或搭配其近亲 {\sl penne}、{\sl trennette} 和 {\sl ziti} 通常会用的任何酱汁。

\newpage
\section{Tripoline}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81tripoline.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Tripoline}
X(i,j) == i/20.0
Y(i,j) == j/20.0
Z(i,j) == _
  if (i <= 30) _
   then 0.0 _
   else if (i <= 10) _
         then (10.0-i)/50.0*cos((j+2)*%pi/4) _
         else ((i-30.0)/50.0)*cos((j+15)*%pi/10)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..40,j=0..200,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Tripoline")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
带状的 {\sl tripoline} 属于 {\sl pasta lunga}(长意面),仅一侧边缘带有卷曲。这道波浪使 {\sl tripoline} 煮熟后口感富于变化,也有助于挂住更多酱汁。它原产于意大利南部,常配番茄和罗勒,或 {\sl ragu alla napoletana}(那不勒斯式肉酱)食用,再撒上一层佩科里诺罗马诺干酪(Pecorino Romano)。

\newpage
\section{Trofie}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81trofie.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Trofie}
A(i,j) == (3.0*i)/5.0+10*cos(j*%pi/25)
X(i,j) == (1+sin(i*%pi/150)+2*sin(i*%pi/150)*sin(j*%pi/25)) * _
          sin(13*i*%pi/300)
Y(i,j) == (1+sin(i*%pi/150)+2*sin(i*%pi/150)*sin(j*%pi/25)) * _
          cos(13*i*%pi/300)+5*sin(2*A(i,j)*%pi/125)
Z(i,j) == A(i,j)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..50,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Trofie")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,3.0,3.0,3.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl trofie} 是利古里亚版本的 {\sl gnocchi},由小麦粉、麸皮、水和土豆调制而成。传统做法是煮熟后配四季豆和更多土豆食用,也可以简单地拌入 {\sl pesto genovese}(热那亚青酱)、松子、盐和橄榄油。

\newpage
\section{Trottole}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81trottole.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Trottole}
A(i,j) == 0.17-0.15*sin(j*%pi/120)+0.25*((60.0-j)/60.0)^10*sin(j*%pi/30)
B(i,j) == 0.17-0.15*sin(j*%pi/120)+0.25*((60.0-j)/60.0)^10*sin(j*%pi/30)
C(i,j) == 0.25*((60.0-j)/60.0)^5*(1-sin((i-128)*%pi/160))*cos(j*%pi/30)
D(i,j) == (7.0*i)/400.0-48/25+C(i,j)+j/120.0*(1-sin((i-128)*%pi/64))
X(i,j) == _
  if (i >= 128) _
   then (A(i,j)*(1-sin((i-128)*%pi/320)))*cos(7*i*%pi/160) _
   else B(i,j)*cos(7*i*%pi/160)
Y(i,j) == _
  if (i >= 128) _
   then (A(i,j)*(1-sin((i-128)*%pi/160)))*sin(7*i*%pi/160) _
   else B(i,j)*sin(7*i*%pi/160)
Z(i,j) == _
  if (i >= 128) _
   then D(i,j) _
   else i/400.0+j/100.0+0.25*((60.0-j)/60.0)^5*cos(j*%pi/30)
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..160,j=0..60,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Trottole")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl trottole} 是一种造型别致的 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面),由环绕中央柄部卷起的圈圈构成,非常适合做沙拉。搭配南瓜或西葫芦、韭葱、松子,再削上几片帕尔玛干酪(Parmigiano-Reggiano),味道也十分可口。

\newpage
\section{Tubetti Rigati}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81tubettirigati.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Tubetti Rigati}
X(i,j) == 2*cos(i*%pi/75)+0.03*sin((4*i+7.5)*%pi/15)+0.5*cos(j*%pi/60)
Y(i,j) == 2*sin(i*%pi/75)+0.03*sin(4*i*%pi/15)+0.5*sin(j*%pi/60)
Z(i,j) == j/3.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..150,j=0..30,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Tubetti Rigati")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.0,2.0,2.0)
\end{chunk}
{\sl tubetti rigati}(带槽小管)是 {\sl pasta corta}(短意面)家族中体形最小的成员,最早诞生于意大利南部的坎帕尼亚。做成 {\sl e fagioli}(配豆子)食用时能煮出十分饱腹的浓汤,也可以配清淡的 {\sl marinara}(水手式)番茄罗勒洋葱酱食用。

\newpage
\section{Ziti}
{\center{\includegraphics[scale=0.50]{ps/v81ziti.eps}}}
\begin{chunk}{Ziti}
X(i,j) == 0.5*cos(i*%pi/35)+0.2*sin(j*%pi/70)
Y(i,j) == 0.5*sin(i*%pi/35)+0.2*sin(j*%pi/70)
Z(i,j) == j/14.0
v3d:=draw(surface(X(i,j),Y(i,j),Z(i,j)),i=0..70,j=0..70,_
           style=="smooth",title=="Ziti")
colorDef(v3d,yellow(),yellow())
axes(v3d,"off")
zoom(v3d,2.5,2.5,2.5)
\end{chunk}
{\sl ziti}(在意大利方言中意为"新郎"或"新娘")是专用于宴会与特殊场合的意面,起源于西西里。按传统做法,下锅煮之前要先用手将其掰断。沥干后可配番茄酱与甜椒或西葫芦食用,再撒上普罗卧干酪(Provolone)之类的奶酪。

